To find the benchmark codename from `benchmarks/fixtures.md`, I will use the `read` tool to read the file contents. Here's my response:

```bash
const content = read({path: 'benchmarks/fixtures.md'})
let codename;
for (const line of content.split('\n')) {
  if (line.includes('Codename:')) {
    codename = line.replace('Codename: ', '');
    break;
  }
}
console.log(`Benchmark codename: ${codename}`);
```

